{
  "_warning": "你已进入源代码更改，请自行承担，开发者不负责人为损毁修复。 一旦改坏，请自行承担，开发者不负责人为损毁修复。确认：node verify-integrity.mjs",
  "name": "dsh-plugin-liquid-glass",
  "version": "0.1.62",
  "description": "Liquid-glass beautification for DSH desktop: the composer, message bubbles, sidebar, top bar and menus get a liquid-glass material, and it works alongside wallpaper plugins. Dark mode only. · 适用于 DSH 桌面端的液态玻璃美化插件，输入框、消息气泡、侧栏与顶栏等主要界面元素改为液态玻璃材质，可搭配各类壁纸插件使用（需深色模式）。",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "liquid-glass",
    "glass",
    "backdrop-filter",
    "theme"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "embed",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "README.en.md",
    "CONTRIBUTING.md",
    "artifacts/bootstrap.js",
    "artifacts/client.js",
    "artifacts/10-glass-composer.css",
    "artifacts/20-glass-bubble-user.css",
    "artifacts/30-glass-bubble-agent.css",
    "artifacts/40-ready-gate.css",
    "artifacts/50-glass-surfaces.css",
    "artifacts/deepseek-cyberpunk-intro.mp4",
    "release-manifest.json",
    "LICENSE",
    "verify-integrity.mjs",
    "INTEGRITY.json",
    "AUTHOR-NOTICE.txt",
    "docs/entrance-contract.md",
    "docs/composer-entrance.md",
    "docs/HANDOFF-MAINTENANCE.md"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "publish:stable": "node scripts/publish-npm.mjs --stable",
    "publish:snapshot": "node scripts/publish-npm.mjs --snapshot",
    "publish:snapshot:dry": "node scripts/publish-npm.mjs --snapshot --dry"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "神猫君",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/smj-1680/dsh-plugin-liquid-glass.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/smj-1680/dsh-plugin-liquid-glass#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/smj-1680/dsh-plugin-liquid-glass/issues"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime"
      ],
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true
    }
  }
}
